1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,210
Now movement.

2
00:00:01,210 --> 00:00:04,153
Plants move in two quite different ways.

3
00:00:04,153 --> 00:00:10,533
Tropic movements are growth movements whose direction is set by the direction of the stimulus.

4
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:15,299
Bending towards light, which we have already seen, is phototropism.

